<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ Galantiyayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galantiyayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ga</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Galantiyayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Naa shɔ gaa nya ruu tɔ̃vɨn waanɛtɛ a Yesɔ yuu, si ɓa yahudawai kɔ sheeli i tɛ ruum rɛɓa, nya hɨnnɛ ta ai tete nɛ yɛ ɔ̃ri shɔutɔ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u gɨn nyaãsinɛ au shɛ a Musa naa nɗa yɛ ɔ̃ kirisa nizɛ kɨn ya? Bulus atette nyamasinɛ gelinɛ ji ɔ̃ ɓa kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɓa, a shanɛ vitɔ̃vɨng a ɓuzɨn ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ sisɨn ãnɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vitɔ̃vɨng a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn. Ama shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gãsiyi ai Galantiya, a Roma ai a tipi Asiya wuja, i shanɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔu gɨn Musa nyaãsinɛtɔ nɗau ɔ̃kɨn tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk" closed="false">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ Galantiyayi bi </char>
    <char style="bk" closed="false">beeriyi aru u sɔri shɔ gbete shɔ nisiyitɛ a nyaɓa sisɨn ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨn ai shonɛni. Bulus gaa shinɛ au nyanwanɛ a tasiyinɛ nɛ nkɔng Yesɔ jashonɛ. Bulus shidɔkaziti nɛm pɛ jashonɛ au shɛ Ɗalapa ɗɔbii ɓa shɔzɛ kaka sɨurɛ ɓa, u kaka vishonɛ si badijo a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa yuu. Kɛɗɔn a yɛ ɗekɨn au nyashanɛni a geliyinɛ ji nyaba sisɨn ãnɛkɔ sheeli shɔ yɛ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn kn a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni. Au gɨn-gɨn naa wasinɛyi Bulus tasinɛ Kirisayi vishonɛ u ɔ̃ atette ɔrinɛ nizɛ au shɛ a sisɨn ãnɛ a Kirisi ɗɔbiiyɛ.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bulus kaka naa jashonɛ (1.11-2.21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ruu tɔ̃vɨn e Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ (3.1-4.31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisayi ɔ̃nɛ yuu ai vishonɛ (5.1-6.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (6.11-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ ang ɗɔbiiko Bulus Kirisi jashonɛ, ɓa shɔzɛ lɔurɛ ɓa, ama shɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii, a Uɓeye shɔgbete yusi Yesɔ a saa a suruniyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ a Ɗabii shɔ gbete i aɗɔm kpai i ɓasi yuu a ukɔɔni aru u gee shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabii gbeteyi a tipi Galantiya nya:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Ɗalapa uɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a binyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kirisi ãu yuu au yuu ruuvini, aru u rau a laduru kɔ̃linɛ jakɨntimiyi naa, ji naa gbete Uɓeye Ɗalapa kasiyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Bassinɛ yɛnɛ Ɗalapa bi yunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn dangdangǃ Nankɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗanyaruubii wɔɔ tɔkɨn ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Viu ɔ̃rintɛ vinamanɛbii aru vigbete ɔ pɛlim, nɔgbete ɔ yaa shɔgbeteu ɓawɔ nya a nyaba Kirisi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ, dɔdɔrim ɔ tɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn wɔɔ tot. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Pɛnizɛ, &lt;&lt;Ruu tɔ̃vɨn wɔɔ tɔɓa,&gt;&gt;ama n sha vim aru shɔwɔyi i ɗɔn gbete i kasɔɔ ɗakinɛ aru i kɔsi Kirisi ruu tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ama ko ukɔ ko Ɗajashonɛlapa, kɛ nwarɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn wɔɔnɛ tot, ɓa gbete u nwarɔɔ yɛ ɓa, mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u lɔkiu a wɛrɛ yaa! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />U shasi tɛttɔ, dɔdɔrim n sha sɔ̃ntɛ tɔti: naa shɔwɔ kɛ nwarɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn wɔɔnɛ tot, ɓa shɔ gbete ɔ tɛyɛ ɓa, Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u lɔkiu a wɛrɛ yaa!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Ɔ̃kɛ naa n kasinɛ shɔzɛ i pɔ̃sinnaa yaa? Ɓa nankɔ ɓa! Vi gbete n kasiyɛ ukɔ Ɗalapa naapɔ̃nɛ! N kasin kɛnɛ shɔu zɛn niitɔ waanɛ yaa? N si kasi nɛn pɛli nankɔ, n si ji ɔ̃ ɓa Kirisi jawɛrɛ ɓa.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vigbete au pɔ̃ Bulus ɔ̃ jashonɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />N gelɔɔ pɛ n shɔbiiyi, ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete n nwari shɔyɛ ji shɛɓa a shɔzɛ nyaɓa. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />N ji tɛ ɓa a shɔzɛ naa ɓa, ɓa shɔwɔɔ matinnɔrɛ ɓa, ama pɛ Yesɔ Kirisi au yuu ukɔ tasinrɛ.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Shɔ gelɔɔ nɔgbete n ɔ̃ si tɛttɔ aɗagbete n si gɨn Ɗalapa naa Yahudawa i si gɨnyɛ, a nɔgbete n tasi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii i raa fɛ̃ɛm, ang pɛli nɔgbete n sãtiyiyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />N tɛɛ n shɔ vaayi gãsiyitɔ aɗagbete sin gɨn shɔ Yahudawayi nyaba gɨnnɛyɛni, n sã mauriyi vi nakootɔ nakaziti ang ãyuutɔ ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ama Ɗalapa au tete tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ lɔnrɛ si shɔ ji yeem ɓa, a ɓang-nyarɛ nɛn ɔ̃ u jawɛrɛ, aɗagbete kasinɛyɛ, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />u tasin nɔgbete ɓɛɛ jaa ɔ̃yɛ, aru nɔgbete n nwari shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ruu tɔ̃vɨn, n ji hɨ shɔ ruu wɔɔ ɓa au yuuni ɓa, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />N ji yɛ shɔgbete i si jashonɛ ang ɗekɨn a Urushalima i ɗɔbii ɓa, ama n yɛkɛ tipi larabawa gbãgbã, kɛɗɔn ang sɔɔ Damasku rɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Si a knti saa taati n yɛ Urushalimarɛ aru ntaruu a Bituru nya, n ɔ̃ au ɗɔbii lee kopi atu maani. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />N ji zɛ jashonɛ wɔɔ ɓa see Yakubu Uɓeyelapa ɓɛzɔ̃.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Vigbete n beeyɛ pɛ nizɛ, Ɗalapa zɛ tɛttɔ n yeeɓa nya ɓa!<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />A kɨntiuni n yɛkɛ tipi Suriya a Kilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />A ɗauni si shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ a Ɗabii a tipi Yahudiya i ji zɛm ɓa shãani ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />I nta ɓɛɛ jo vigbete shɔwɔyi shayɛ nɛː &lt;&lt;Jaa gbete au si tasiu raayɛ, dɔdɔrim u ɗɔgbete nwari shɔ ruu sisɨn ãnɛ gbete sãti siyɛǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Kɛɗɔn i bɛli Ɗalapa nii rɛ ang yuu.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Gãsi jashonɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />A saa kopi atu nɛ̃ɛ̃ti au tɛyɛ n sɔɔ Urushalima a Barnaba ni, n tuu Titus a naani. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />N yɛrɛ aru si Ɗa tasin tɛttɔ nɛn yɛnɛ, aɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ gbete u ɔ̃ a yupɛ̃niyini yɛ a ɗɔgoti, n tasiyidɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete n nwari shɔgbete i ɓa yahudawa ɓa yɛtɔ, n ji kasiɓa n vishonɛ gbete n pɛli akɨnti ko dɔdɔrim u lɛsirɛ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />N shɔ dɔranɛ Titus, ko u pɛ shɔ Helena shɔ ji yeeriu shaa ɓa a kakabi ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Shɔ gãsiyi i kasinɛ si ɔ̃ nankɔ, i tasi yuu naa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi Ɗabii, shɔmiyi i to u kɨn rɛ kali, aru i zɛ nyaba naranɛ gbete u awuni a ka Yesɔ Kirisi. I kasiu jafoo risinɛ, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ama aru u kasirɛ u pɔ̃ ruu tɔ̃vɨn tɛpɛ- tɛpɛ awɔ yuu, u ji yasiyi nyaba ɓa ko jaafẽ.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ama shɔgbete shɔ tuyi nɛi pɛ yupɛ̃niyi yɛ, n sha vim aru ang ɗɔbii i ɓa viwɔ ɓa; aruviya Ɗalapa yeeruu ɓa ayuu vigbete shɔzɛ nɔɔ zɛyɛ ɓa, yupɛ̃ni miyi i ji n ti visɔɔ ɓa ang ruuni ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />A nyaba wɔɔ i zɛrɛ nɛ Ɗalapa ãng naa tɛttɔ n nwari shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ruu tɔ̃vɨn, ji nagbete Ɗalapa ã Bituru naa u nwari Yahudawayi ruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />A Ɗalapa kakakɔ n ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa jashonɛ, ji naa gbete pɔ̃ Bituru ɔ̃ Yahudawayi jashonɛyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakub, Bituru a Yɔhanani shɔgbete shɔ zɛnaa ikɔyi yupɛ̃ni, i zɛrɛ nɛpɛ Ɗalapa ãng vishonɛ pɛ̃niɓamrɛ; Kɛɗɔn i tɛn naa kaziti a Barnaba ni gbete tasinɛ u pɛ gbete ayini, u matɛttɔ Barnaba a nkɔni u yɛ pɛli vishonɛ atette shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, i pɛli sɔ̃njo a Yahudawayi tete. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Vigbete i piti kpai i kasiyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ai kn u kpaasisɨntɔ a shɔraayi biini, shomji vigbete sin pɔ̃ a sisɨn a lee-lee n-tɛ n pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus lasi Bituru a Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ama naa Bituru a Antakiya tɛ, n lasiutɔ a shɔ nɔɔ aru vigbete pɛliyɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Shɔgbete Yakub shoyiyɛ i ɓɛɛ anɛ a ɗɔuni, si Bituru shaalivitɛttɔ a shɔgbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabii ai ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ni. Ama akɨnti gbete shɔwiyi toyɛ, Bituru gɔ̃biirɛ nɛn shaavi tokɨn ɓa a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ni, aru ntaseti Yahudawa gbeteyi ãsisɨntɛ ayuu shaa yeenɛ yɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Gãsi Yahudawa gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗabii i ɗaki shɔ sɔ̃njo naa Bituru, a Barnaba ma gɨn sɔ̃njɔ nankɔ ai vikɔ̃linɛ shɔ ɗakinɛuni. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Naa n zɛtɛ i ji pɛli vishonɛ ɓa a nyaba tɔ̃vɨn gbete ruu tɔ̃vɨn shayɛni ɓa, n geli Bituru ai ɗekɨn piti kpai nɛ, &lt;&lt;Apɛ shɔ Yahudawa, ama a pɛli vi naa a ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, ɓa naa shɔ Yahudawayi ɓa. Kɛɗɔn aru ivi a kasinɛn pɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɔ̃ naa Yahudawa viya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahudawa a Shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɔ̃ A suru ni aru sisɨn ãnɛ aɗɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />U ɓɛɛ Yahudawayi a yeenɛ, u ɓa&lt;&lt;Shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa shɔruuviniyi,&gt;&gt; nagbete i ɓaayɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />U zɛ tɛttɔ shɔ ranaa ɓa a Ɗa ɗɔbiini ɓa see a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛkɔ sheeli a Yesɔ Kirisi bi, ɓa nyaba vigbete Musa nya-ãsinɛ shayɛ ɓa, ukoma u ã sisɨntɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi bi aru u kpaa naraanɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, a nya u sisɨn ãnɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ bi, ama ɓa vishonɛ gbete nya-ãsinɛ shayɛ ɓa, shɔwɔɔ yɛ kpaa naraanɛ ɓa a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii a nyaba vishonɛ gbete nya-ãsinɛ shayɛni ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Kɛɗɔn kɛ ɔ̃nɛ u kasirɛ u kpaa naraanɛ u ɔ̃ gbete a kirisini, shɔ kpaurɛ u pɛ shɔruuvini, naa shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ɔ̃yɛ, shɔ tɔkɛnɛ Kirisi pɛli kɛ vishonɛ ruuvini ya? Ɓa nankɔ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ama nkɛ gaa nya-ãsinɛ gbete n sãti siyɛ sɔɔrinɛ nɛ, kɛɗɔn n tasin yuutɛ naa shɔgbeteu ka nya-ãsinɛyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Nagbete nya-ãsinɛ ɔ̃yɛ, n pɛ shɔ gbete vɔtɛttɔyɛ, nya-ãsinɛ nyonrɛ au yuu, aru n ɔ̃ a suruni a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii. Shɔ nyon tɛttɔ a Kirisini a gbete shɔ ɓaunalaayɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Dɔdɔrim ɓa nkɔng shɔgbete u a suruni ɓa, ama pɛ Kirisi shɔgbete ang biiyɛ. N ɔ̃nɛ gbete n ɔ̃ dɔdɔrim yɛ, n ɔ̃ atette sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗa jaabii, shɔgbete ɔrinyɛ a ãu suru ang yuu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />N ji bẽẽ Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ ɓa. Ama shɔkɛ pɔ̃ shɔnɛ u ɔ̃ a Ɗalapa kabii a nyaba nya-ãsinɛ, vim tasikɛtɛ nɛ Kirisi vɔnɛ ɓa viwɔɔ ɓaǃ<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nya-ãsinɛ ko Sisɨn-ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Ɔ shɔ Galantiya rãnmiyiǃ pi tuwɔ sisɨn piya? Ɔ shɔgbete ɔ zɛ ruu Yesɔ kirisi naa ɓanɛ laa tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛmǃ <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />N yɛn hɨn ɔ ruu gbete sheeli: Ɔ tɛ Ɗa suru a nyaba vigbete nya-ãsinɛ shayɛ ya? ko nyaba gbete ɔ nta ruu tɔ̃vɨn awɔ ã sisɨnrɛ a ɗɔniya? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Ɔ ɔ̃ rãn pikoviyaǃ Ɔ gaa a Ɗa suru; dɔdɔrim ɔ kasiu nya yisinɛkɛ awɔ kaka ya? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Ɔ raboonɛ ayuu vigbete ɔ pɛliyɛ ɔ̃kɛtɛ weze ya? Pɛ nizɛ ɔ̃tɛ viwɔǃ <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ɗalapa ãwɔ u surutɛ ɔ pɛli vibiizaanɛ awɔ atette aru ɔ pɛli vigbete nya ãsinɛ ãsiyɛ ya ko aru ɔ nta ruu tɔ̃vɨn ɔ ã sisɨnrɛ ɗɔn ya?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Ɔ kɨnnɔɔ pɛ a Ibirayi vizɛnɛ; nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ibirayi ã sisɨntɔ a Ɗa biini, jo au ruu sisɨn ãnɛkɔ Ɗalapa tɛu naarɛ aru u shɔtɔ̃vɨng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ nɛ, Ibirayi jawuru tɔ̃vɨnyi ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete ai ã sisɨn a Ɗabiiyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ɗanyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ pɔ̃ shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa au kabii a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ. Aruukɔ Ɗanyaruubii geli Ibirayi ruu tɔ̃vɨn tɛttɔ nɛ: &lt;&lt;Jo aa kabiikɔ Ɗalapa yɛ tasi shɔ vɔɔ susãrirɛ bi a koo piti kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Ibirayi ã sisɨnrɛ a Ɗalapa tasiu vɔɔ susãrirɛ abi; aruukɔ shɔgbete ai ã sisɨn yɛ piti kpai Ɗalapa tasiyɛ vɔɔ susãrirɛ abi nɔgbete tasi Ibirayi yɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Shɔgbete ai kɛ gɨnnɛ nya-ãsinɛ, i yɛ wiriyitɔ. Aru Ɗanyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete au ji gɨn vigbete a yɛti laabeenɛ nya-ãsinɛ ɓa a lee-lee ɓa i yɛ wiritɔǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Dɔdɔrim tasi tɛttɔ wasa-wasa shɔwɔɔyɛ ranaa ɓa a nya-ãsinɛ gɨnnɛni ɓa, aru gbete nya-ãsinɛ shatɛttɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Se shɔgbete Ɗalapa tɛi naa kɔsheeli ukɔi yɛ kpaa naraarɛ i ɔ̃ a suru ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ama nya-ãsinɛ yuu ji wau ɓa a sisɨn ãnɛni ɓa, ama Ɗanyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔgbete kɛ pɛli vigbete nya-ãsinɛ ãsiyɛ nɛ kpai yɛ ɔ̃ a suru ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Ama Kirisi rautɛ a wirinɛ gbete nya-ãsinɛ n-tiuyɛni; aru Ɗanyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete shɔkɛ bau naa nɛ a yulaa si Ɗalapa wiriutɛttɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Kirisi pɛlivim aru vɔɔ susari gbete Ɗalapa ma a Ibirayi nɛ shɔyɛ ã shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii, a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ uyɛ tɛ Ɗa suru gbete Ɗalapa ma nɛn ãuyɛtɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya-ãsinɛ a ruumanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />N shɔbiiyi n yɛn nwanya a ɔkɔɔni n pɛli vishonɛ a vitasinɛ ko-pi ɗaviyaː Naa shɔzɛ ziti i kɛ maruunɛ i pɔ̃naa a yuuni, shɔ wɔ yɛ zɔ̃ ruu dɔɔɓa ko u pɔ̃ viwɔ au yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa maruu a Ibirayi a ɓɛuruyi ni. Ɗanyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ shɔyɛ ɓaa ɓa nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɓɛwuruyi ɓa,&gt;&gt; ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔzɛ waanɛ, ama ji shɔgbete ɓa waanɛ ɓa shɔ ɓaa nɛ, &lt;&lt;ɓɛwuru,&gt;&gt; ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔzɛ gbete sheeli, u niinɛ Kirisi. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Vigbete n sha a ɗɔmyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shom, Ɗalapa maruu a Ibirayi a marɛ nɛ ruu manɛu yɛ ɔ̃tɔ. Nya ãsinɛ gbete shɔ ã a saa laa -laa ziti au jaa bmati atu kop akɨnti, shɔ zɛnɔɔ ruu manɛu vɔsinɛ dɔɔɓa a nyɔ Ɗa ruu manɛurɛ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Si shɔ tɔnɛ Ɗalapa vi-ãnɛ shi ayuu ruu nya-ãsinɛkɔ sheeli, kɛɗɔn si shɔ ji shi ɓa ayuu ruu maanɛni ɓa. Si ɓɛjo a ruumanɛnkɔ Ɗalapa ã Ibirayi vi-ãnɛurɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Kɛɗɔn nya ãsinɛ vishonɛu ɓɛkɛ iviya? Shɔ pɔ̃ nya-ãsinɛm aru shɔu tasi vigbete vikɔ̃linɛ pɛliyɛ, sɔ̃nya aɗagbete Ibirayi laduruyi yɛ a yɛ, shɔgbete a Ɗalapa maruu a wuniyɛ. Nya ãsinɛ Ɗalapa ã a Ɗajashonɛlapayi naa, ai tuurɛ i nɔsi a Musa naa, kɛɗɔn Musa tuu nya-ãsinɛu a ã shɔ a naa. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ama ayuu ruumanɛu Ɗalapa ji kã shɔ ruudɔtinɛ ɓa; Ɗalapa ji gbete.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya-ãsinɛ Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Nya-ãsinɛu tasikɛ nɛ ji kasi Ɗalapa ruumaanɛu ɓaya? Ɓa, Ɗalapau zãritɔ! Naa shɔzɛ kɛ tɛ nya-ãsinɛ gbete yɛ n-tiu suruyɛnɛ, kɛɗɔn ko-piya au kɛ gɨn nya-ãsinɛunɛyɛ shɔ yɛ pɔ̃u a Ɗalapa kabii. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ama Ɗanyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ kotipim piti kpai ɔ̃ atette ruuvini kaka; kɛɗɔn ruumaanɛ gbete shɔ ã shɔyɛ, shɔ ã jo nɔgbete i kaka sisɨn ãnɛ sãyɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii, shɔ ã jo shɔgbete ai ã sisɨn aɗɔnyɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Ama aɗagbete si ɗaa sisɨn ãnɛ ji a ɓayɛ, nya-ãsinɛ mau naa shɔjahmyi yɛnɛ ɗagbete sisɨn-ãnɛ tasiu yuuyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Aru nankɔ nya-ãsinɛkɔ sãurɛ yɛnɛ ɗagbete Kirisi a yɛ, nɔgbete au nyaba sisɨn-ãnɛkɔ Ɗalapayɛ tɛunaarɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Dɔdɔrim ɗaa sisɨn ãnɛ atɛ yɛm, nya-ãsinɛ u kaka tɔɓa au yuuni ɓa.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ji nyaba sisɨn ãnɛkɔ ɔ piti kpai ɔ ɔ̃ Ɗalapa jaayirɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Shɔ pɛlɔɔ batizimatɛ piti a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii, dɔdɔrim ɔ hã fãrã tɛ u shapɛ nankɔ, ɔ tosi Kirisitɛ naa fãrã a bi. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Kɛɗɔn vɔsinɛ wɔɔ ɓa atette Yahudawayi a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa yini, vɔsinɛ ɓa atette fooyi a shɔ wezeni ɓa, atette vɔshɔ a soroyini ɓa; aru ɔ piti kpai ɔ gbete a Yesɔ kirisi kabiini. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />A kɛ ɔ̃nɛ kirisi ɓɛɛ, ɔ̃kɛtɛ ɔ pɛ Ibirayi ɓɛwuruyi ai yɛ kpaa vigbete Ɗalapa mayɛtɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ama dɔdɔrim n yɛ ɗekɨn a vigbete n sha siyɛ, jaa gbete yɛ shaa ɓɛyɛ vivɔyɛ, shɔ tasiu raa naa foo aɗagbete u doo jakasayɛ, a nɔgbete u ɓeye vipɛu ɓɛɛkɔ piti kpai. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Aɗagbete u si jakasayɛ, shɔwɔɔyi sidɔn gbete i kɔuyɛ ai kɔsiu vinaayɛ, yɛnɛ ɗagbete u ɓeye pɔ̃yɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Ji nyabankɔ, u si jo nankɔ aɗagbete usi foo a suru gbete au shovi a kotipim, siu ji kpẽ ɓa a nyaba Ɗa gɨnnɛni ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ama naa ɗagbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ pɛlitɛ, se Ɗalapa yɛ sho kɛ ɓɛɛ jaa. Ɓɛɛ jaa a naa javɔshɔ gbete soro yeeyɛ a ɔ̃ atette Musa nya-ãsinɛ, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />aruviya u raa shɔgbeteyi a nya-ãsinɛ naa, nɔgbete u yɛ ɔ̃ kɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛjaayiyɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />U tasinɛ ɔ pɛ ɓɛɛ jaayi, Ɗalapa sho ɓɛɛ jaa suru au sisɨn, Ɗa suru gbete ɓaanya au sisɨn nɛ, &lt;&lt;Abba, Da!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ tokɨn foo ɓa ama ɔ pɛ Ɗa jaa. Nagbete ɔ pɛ ɓɛɛ jaa, Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔ vigbete pɔ̃si ɓɛɛ jaayitɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Yɔriyuu Aru Shɔ Galantiya Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Akɨnti si ɔ ji zɛ Ɗalapa ɓa, aruukɔ ɔ si fooyi a vigbeteyi suru ɓa i ɗɔbii gbeteyi ɓa viwɔyi ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ama dɔdɔrim gbete ɔ zɛ Ɗalapa tɛm, ko n shanɛ, dɔdɔrim gbete Ɗalapa zɛɔtɛm- ɔ yɛ sɔɔ kɨnti kɛpikovi nɛi gɨn vigbete ai suru ɓa ɗɔnɓa viya? Aru ivi ɔ kasi ɔ̃nɛ jafoo toti viya? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn ayuu leeyi, shɛlɛyi, ɗaayi a saayi. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />N yɔriyuutɔ awɔ yuuni! Ɔ̃kɛtɛ n vishonɛ gbete n pɛli awɔ yuuyɛ weze ya?<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />N gakɔɔtɔ n shɔbiiyi ɔ ɔ̃ ji naa nkɔ. Aruviya n ji naa ɔkɔɔ, ɔ ji pɛlin vikɔ̃linɛ wɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ a Ɗanyaruubii gbete n gaa wɔ nwarinɛ yɛ; si aru gbete n si vɔrɔyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ama n ruu vɔrɔu si yukɔnɛ awɔ ɗɔbi ni, a shomni kpai ɔ ji bɛ̃ɛ̃m ɓa nɔɔni ɓa, ama ɔ tɛn naa kaziti naa Ɗajashonɛ wɔɔ gbete shɛ a kolapa yɛ; ɔ tɛn naa kaziti nagbete ɔ yɛ tɛ Kirisi Yesɔ yɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Ɔ nta sisɨn purutɔ waanɛǃ Ivi ɗɔyɛnɛ viya? N ang yuu nsi shatɔ nɛ ɔ kuki nɔɔtɔ, naa ɔ si pɛlitɔyɛ, ɔ ãyirɛ a naa. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Dɔdɔrim n ɔ̃tɛ ɔ shɔnɔpɔ̃ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete n gelɔɔyɛni ya?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Shɔwɔyi i tasɔɔ ɔrinɛtɔ pɛ̃niba awɔ yuuni, ama vigbete i kasɔɔ pɛlinɛyɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa. Vigbeteyi kasi pɛlinɛyɛ kpai nɛi vɔsɔtɔ a nkɔni, nɔgbete ɔ yɛ pɔ̃ sisɨn ai bi naa i pɔ̃sisɨn awɔ ɓɛɛyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Dɔdɔrim yɛ kɔritɔ ɔ vipɛlinɛ u ɔritɔ fɛ̃ɛm, kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a nyaba tɔ̃vɨnyɛ --shompɛ tɔ̃vɨn kopiɗaviya, ɓanɛ aɗagbete n a ɔkɔɔni sheeli ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Majaa ɔrinɛyiǃ ji naa gbete jaa ɓini nta kɔnɛ a ɗa jaa yeenɛ, n nta kɔnɛ jo nankɔ awɔ yuuni, yɛnɛ leegbete Kirisi ruubii ɔ̃ awɔ sisɨnyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Si tɔnɛn ɔ̃ n kasinɛ dɔdɔrim n si a nyazɔ a ɔkɔɔni, aruviya n si kɔsin sisɨntɔ awɔ yuuni. N yɔriyuu tɛttɔ awɔ yuuni waanɛ!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vitasinɛ a Hajaratu a Saratu i yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />N hɨ ɔ pɛ pi kasinɛn gɨn Musa nya-ãsinɛ piyaː ɔ ji nta vigbete nya-ãsinɛ shayɛ ɓaya? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Nya-ãsinɛ shanɛ, Ibirayi u javɔshɔ aɗɔn ziti, gbete suu foo yeerɛ, awɔ kɛ su laajaa gbete u ɓa su foo ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Javɔshɔ gbete yee a su foo, shɔ yeeu jo nɔgbete shɔ yeejaayɛ, ama shɔgbete yee a su gbete u ɓa foo ɓau, shɔ yeeu ɓɛɛ nɔgbete Ɗalapa mayɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Vim kpai shɔ pɛli ayuu vi ziti: su zitimiyi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ruumanɛ ziti. jaa gbete shɔ yeeyi jaa fooyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Haga ɓɛɛ jaa. ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ ruu gbete shɔ ma a kɔpɔ Sinayiyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Haga ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ a nɔɔ kɔpɔ sinayi a tipi Larabawa, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nɔɔ zɛnɛ a komoo Urashalima, i foo kɔ piti a ɓɛɛshɔzɛni kpai. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ama Urushalima gbete u a lapa u ɓa foo ɓa, u pɛ u ɓini. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Aru Ɗanyaruubii shatɛttɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;&lt;Nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ su gbete a yeejaa ɓam!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Kanya lapa a sisɨn puru ntanɛni, shɔ gbete a ji ta yugboti ɓa shããɓam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Aru su gbete shɔ ji wayuɓa au biini ɓa yɛ kpaa jaa waanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">u tɛɛ su gbete ji vɔsi ɓa a ɓɛvɔni shããɓatɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Dɔdɔrim n shɔbiiyi, ɔ pɛ Ɗalapa jaayi a ruumanɛ gbete mayɛ, naa gbete Ishayaku ɔ̃ siyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />A ɗauni jaa gbete shɔ yee nɔgbete shɔ yeejaayɛ tasi shɔgbete shɔ yeeu a Ɗa suru raatɔ; dɔdɔrim ma ji nankɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ama Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ iviya? shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yiki su foou kati a ɓɛɛ jaani; Aruviya su foou jaa yɛ vɔsi vivɔ ɓa a su laajaa jaani atette ɓeye vini ɓa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Aru nankɔ n shɔbiiyi, u ɓa su foo jaayi ɓa, ama u ɓɛɛ su laajaa ɓɛɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ Sãwɔ ɔ̃nɛ Yuutɔ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />U ɔ̃nɛ u yuu aɗɔn, aruviya Kirisi rautɛttɔǃ Ɔ shi naa shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ yuu aɗɔn, ɔkɔɔ yawɔ yuunɛ ɔ ɔ̃ sɔ̃n foo ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Weshopɛ! Nkɔ Bulus n gelɔɔtɛ ɔkɛ ãwɔ yuunɛ nɛ shɔu yeerɔɔ shaa, si ɔ̃kɛtɛ Kirisi ruubii ɓa viwɔ awɔ ɗɔbiini ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />N gɔ̃wɔ yuusho sɔ̃n pɛ toti, shɔu kɛ yaanɛ nɛ shɔu yeerin shaatɔ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng au kɔrɔ u gɨn Musa nya-ãsinɛtɔ piti kpai. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ɔ shɔgbete ɔ kã naraanɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii a nyaba Musa nya-ãsinɛ gɨnnɛ, ɔ vawɔ yuutɛ a Ɗalapa kabiini, ɔ ɓa tete shɔgbeteyi kpaa Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛni ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ama au kabii, u sisɨnpɔ̃nɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ u kpaa naraanɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii; Ɗa Suru kaka gbete shovi au nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete u gaa yɛkɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Naa ukɛ ɓasiyunɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni, ko shaa yeenɛ ko ɓa shaa yeenɛ ɓa ji ɔ̃ɓa viwɔɔ ɓa; vitɔ̃vɨng gbete au yɔri shɔ yuuyɛ pɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabii au shovi atette ɔrinɛyɛ.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Si ɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng! Pi zãrɔɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ piya? Gɨn ɔ pi koviya? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Si ɓa Ɗalapa gbete au ɓawɔ nyayɛ vishonɛ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Nagbete shɔ shayɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ji vuru fɛ̃ɛ̃mkɔ pɔ̃ borodi rɛ u ɔ̃ pɛ̃niba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Ama n bi dooɗɔ lakinɛ awɔ yuuni. U ɔ̃nɛ yuɓasinɛ au Uɓeyelapani ukɔ pɔ̃nrɛ n bilakirɛ aruviya ɔ yɛ kɔsi sisɨn ɓa, shɔgbete au kɛ tɔnɛn pɔ̃wɔ yukɔnɛ Ɗalapa yɛ gɔ̃u yushotɔ.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ama n shɔbiiyi kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ang yuu, nkɛ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔ ɗekɨn yɛnɛ a nyawaanɛ aru shaa yeenɛni, shɔ tasin raa sɔ̃n kɛpi aru iviya? Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nizɛ, kɛɗɔn n Ɗanyaruubii waanɛ aru laa gbete shɔ ɓaa Kirisi naa ɗɔnyɛ yɛ n ti yukɔnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ang kasinɛ shɔgbeteyi i tasɔɔ raayɛ i ɔ̃ ji nankɔ kpai; i yɛɗekn ai yuu boodorinɛǃ<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɔkɔɔ n shɔbiiyi, Ɗalapa ɓawɔ nyatɛ ɔ ɔ̃ awɔ yuu. Ama ɔkɔɔ yawɔ ɔ̃nɛ yuunɛ u pɔ̃wɔrɛ ɔ pɛli vigbete ɔ kasi pɛlinɛyɛ. Ama ɔrinɛ u pɔ̃rɛ ɔ pɛli zɔ vitɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Aruviya nya-ãsinɛu piti kpai nwanya ayuu vigbete nɛː &lt;&lt;A ɔraa shɔnyakãsiri nagbete a ɔraa yuuyɛ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ama ɔkɛ pɛli vinɛ naa viɓiliyi, ɔ ɗɔ ɔ zɔ nɔrɔ ntarinɛ, ɔ ɗɔ zɔ lɛsinɛ, ɔ kɔyuutɔ, ɔ yɛ lɛsi zɔtɔ kpai.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vigbete Suru Ãyɛ a Shɔzɛ Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Vigbete n shayɛ ukɔ shomː ɔ yaa Ɗa suru u tasɔɔ nyaba ɔ̃nɛ, Ɔ yɛ pɔ̃ ɗɔɔɓa vi kotipim u tesi shɔrɛ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Aruviya vigbete shɔzɛ kasiyɛ, Ɗa suru kasi ɓa ukɔ ɓa, a vigbete Ɗa suru kasiyɛ shɔzɛ kasi ɓa ukɔ ɓa. Vi zitimiyi i ɔ̃kɛ shɔnɔpɔ̃ a zɔni, vim tasitɛ nɛ a yɛ zɛnɔɔ vigbete a kasi pɛlinɛyɛ ɗɔɔɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗa surukɔ tesɔɔ ɗekɨn rɛ, kɛɗɔn Musa nya-ãsinɛ u kaka ɓa awɔ yuuni ɓa.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Shɔzɛ vipɛlinɛ ɓɛɛ ji a ɓili weze, tasiu yuutɔ a kpangtang pɛlinɛni, vikɔ̃linɛni, a fãrã kɔ̃linɛ hãnɛ; <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />a jaɗa bassinɛ a shɔgãyini. Shɔzɛyi i ɔ̃kɛ shɔnɔpɔ̃ a zɔni i waabarɛ; i kaagɨn a zɔni, i lɛsi sisɨnrɛ, a yuu ɔrinɛni. I vɔsi yuu kɛ a dɔlaa-dɔlaa a kɨ̃nkɨ̃n; <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />i yɔri yuutɔ, visiutɔ, a nyamokinɛ, a gãsi viwɔyini. N gɔ̃wɔ yushotɛ dɔdɔrim nagbete n gɔ̃wɔ siyɛː Shɔgbeteyi pɛli vim piti kpai i yɛ kpaa Ɗalapa kpati roonɛ ɓa.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ama Ɗa suru n ti ɓɛɛ ɔrinɛ, sisɨn puru ntanɛ, ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ, sisɨnmɛɛnɛ, tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ, vitɔ̃vɨng, vipɛlinɛ a sisɨn gbete, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />yuroorinɛ, a yuu sãnɛ. Nya-ãsinɛ wɔɔ ji zãri vimiyi ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Shɔ gbeteyi pɛ Kirisi Yesɔ ɓɛɛ yɛ, i nyo shɔzɛ vipɛlinɛ kotipitɛ gboti ai vikasinɛni. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ɗa Suru ãu surutɛ; yɛ ɔ̃riu kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u kɔu surutɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u baasinɛ ɓa, ukɔu ɗasi zɔnɛ ko u kagɨnnɛ a zɔni.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ Tuu Zɔ Yukɔnɛtɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />N shɔbiiyi, shɔkɛ sã shɔwɔnɛ adɔɔ vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ, ɔ shɔgbete ɔ a Ɗa Suruniyɛ ɔ sãurɛ ɔ sɔriu a nyaban tɔ̃vɨn; Ama ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a ɗagbete ɔ pɛliyɛ ɔ rooriyuutɔ, ko-piya u kɔuyuutɔ nɔgbete ukɔma yɛ kɔdɔɔ ɓayɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Ɔ pɔ̃si zɔ naatɔ a raaboonɛni, a nyabankɔ ɔ kɛ pɛlinɛ si ɔ yɛ gɨn Kirisi nya ãsinɛtɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Shɔwɔɔ kɛ tuu yuunɛ nɛn pɛ viwɔ ama u ɓa viwɔ ɓa, a ɗaki ɓɛɛ ji ayuu weze. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Kopiya u biliu yuu pɛtɔ u zɛrɛ, kɛ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn kɛɗɔn kopiya yɛ baasi kɛ au yuuni, nɔgbete yɛ teesiu yuu ɓa a vigbete shɔwɔɔ pɛliyɛni ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Aruviya ko-piya u tuu jo u vituunɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Shɔkɛ mataa ruu Kirisinɛ, a mati shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng gbete a shɔmala mataayɛ sɔ̃njo.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ɔkɔɔ ɗakɔɔ yuunɛ; Shɔwɔɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ Ɗalapa mɛɛnɛ dɔɔɓa, vigbete a ɓaayɛ a kpaa sɔ̃njo ukɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />A kɛ ɓaa vinɛ aru vigbete a sisɨn kasiyɛ, a yɛ yee vigbete yɛ nyo a vɔrɔyɛ ji ukɔ; a kɛ ɓaa vinɛ a nyaba Ɗa suru, ji nyaba Ɗa surukɔ a yɛ yee suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ dangdang rɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Ukɔɔ yɔɔnɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛni; aruviya u ji ã yuu ɓa, kɛɗɔn ɗaa kɛ pɛlinɛ u yɛ yeevitɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Aru nankɔ ukɛ kpaa nyabanɛ u pɛli ko-piya vitɔ̃vɨngtɔ, badijo shɔgbete u wɛrɛ gbete atette sisɨn ãnɛyɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yushogɔ̃nɛ au Wasina a Nyageenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Ɔ zɛ sẽkoo pɛ̃niba gbete dɔdɔrim n beerɔɔ ang naayɛǃ <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Shɔ gbeteyi kasɔɔ pɔ̃nɛ a kaka nɛ shɔ yeerɔ shaa yɛ, ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbeteyi baasirɛ a tasi yuu bɛli, i pɛli vim aru shɔyɛ tasiyi raarɛ aru Kirisi naɓaanɛ laa. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ko shɔgbete shɔ yeeri shaayɛ ma i gɨn nya-ãsinɛ ɓa; i kasinɛ shɔu yeerɔ shaa nɔgbete i ɓaasi kɨn awɔ yuu nɛ shɔ yeerɔ shaatɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ama ɓɛɛ ang bi n baasi ɓɛɛ aru gbete shɔ ɓaa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi nalaayɛ; aru gbete shɔ ɓau nalaakɔ, n lɔki ruu kotipitɛ, kotipi ma lɔkin ruubiitɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ruu shaa yeenɛ ko shɔ ji yee shaa ɓa, ɓa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ viwɔ ɓa; vigbete ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn a ɓuzɨn ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete Ɗalapa shɛshi sɔɔyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Aru shɔgbeteyi gɨn nya-ãsinɛmiyi ai ɔ̃nɛ kpai, binyatɔ̃nɛ a shɔraantanɛ u ɔ̃ a ikɔ ni a Ɗalapa ɓɛshɔzɛ Israilayini kpai!<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />U yisinɛ: shɔwɔɔkɔ n ting yukɔnɛ nɛ toti, aruviya nɔrɔ gbete ang bim tasi tɛttɔ nɛn pɛ Yesɔ foo.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />N shɔbiiyi n gaki Ɗa mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni kpai. Nankɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>